            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mow-down at the hoedown!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack your bags and move to the idyllic countryside. Pay no heed to the nuclear fallout – it adds a lovely glow to your complexion! Upsides – everyone wants a piece of you! Downsides – everyone wants a piece of you...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your blunderbuss and get ready for twin-stick, bullet-hell, roguelite, corn-chuckin' action game that will last until the cows come home! As any self-respecting farmer would: Farm. Marry. Kill.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/c030b41958b867621359773be979817b.poster.avif?t=1793631535\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/c030b41958b867621359773be979817b.webm?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/c030b41958b867621359773be979817b.mp4?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sow and harvest as many fast-growing crops as you can before the day is done to earn a huge profit. Purchase weapons and items in town at the end of each day. Celebrate the end of each season with special shops and rewards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently Upgrade your farming and fighting abilities. Earn a payout each run that can be used on permanent improvements and unlocks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the years with ramping difficulty and even greater rewards! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/a9fcb7cd6319de89f4ab88da40841b68.poster.avif?t=1793631535\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/a9fcb7cd6319de89f4ab88da40841b68.webm?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/a9fcb7cd6319de89f4ab88da40841b68.mp4?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend an entourage of pig pals, chicken chums, and cow colleagues to automate farming tasks. Woo and marry a kindred spirit from the local town to fight and farm alongside you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters, spouses, difficulties, and permanent upgrades. Most importantly, you can unlock many cats to permanently roam your homestead (yes, you can pet them).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/51c89ee3fa840ba24811bd6d6ed1d2e7.poster.avif?t=1793631535\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/51c89ee3fa840ba24811bd6d6ed1d2e7.webm?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/51c89ee3fa840ba24811bd6d6ed1d2e7.mp4?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your crops from unforgiving nightly attackers looking to rampage your hard-earned harvest. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight challenging bosses each season until you reach the final season - the Nuclear Winter.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the far reaches of the biomes to find useful relics of farms long past. Powerful loot increases your farming abilities and helps you fight enemies. </p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mow-down at the hoedown!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack your bags and move to the idyllic countryside. Pay no heed to the nuclear fallout – it adds a lovely glow to your complexion! Upsides – everyone wants a piece of you! Downsides – everyone wants a piece of you...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your blunderbuss and get ready for twin-stick, bullet-hell, roguelite, corn-chuckin' action game that will last until the cows come home! As any self-respecting farmer would: Farm. Marry. Kill.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/c030b41958b867621359773be979817b.poster.avif?t=1793631535\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/c030b41958b867621359773be979817b.webm?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/c030b41958b867621359773be979817b.mp4?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sow and harvest as many fast-growing crops as you can before the day is done to earn a huge profit. Purchase weapons and items in town at the end of each day. Celebrate the end of each season with special shops and rewards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently Upgrade your farming and fighting abilities. Earn a payout each run that can be used on permanent improvements and unlocks. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the years with ramping difficulty and even greater rewards! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/a9fcb7cd6319de89f4ab88da40841b68.poster.avif?t=1793631535\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/a9fcb7cd6319de89f4ab88da40841b68.webm?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/a9fcb7cd6319de89f4ab88da40841b68.mp4?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend an entourage of pig pals, chicken chums, and cow colleagues to automate farming tasks. Woo and marry a kindred spirit from the local town to fight and farm alongside you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new characters, spouses, difficulties, and permanent upgrades. Most importantly, you can unlock many cats to permanently roam your homestead (yes, you can pet them).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/51c89ee3fa840ba24811bd6d6ed1d2e7.poster.avif?t=1793631535\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/51c89ee3fa840ba24811bd6d6ed1d2e7.webm?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/757320/extras/51c89ee3fa840ba24811bd6d6ed1d2e7.mp4?t=1793631535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your crops from unforgiving nightly attackers looking to rampage your hard-earned harvest. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight challenging bosses each season until you reach the final season - the Nuclear Winter.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the far reaches of the biomes to find useful relics of farms long past. Powerful loot increases your farming abilities and helps you fight enemies. </p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Cultiva. Casa. Mata. Atomicrops é um simulador de agricultura roguelite e cheio de ação, no qual deves cultivar e defender a última quinta num deserto pós-apocalíptico. Cultiva plantas mutantes, casa com os habitantes, e mata todas as criaturas mutantes que tentem invadir!",
